                <head>Agreements between the United States and Ireland</head>
                <p>[For text of Agreement, signed at Dublin June 28, 1948, see Department of State,
                    Treaties and Other International Acts Series No. 1788.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND IRELAND RESPECTING
                    APPLICATION OF MOST-FAVORED-NATION TREATMENT TO AREAS UNDER OCCUPATION OR
                    CONTROL</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement, effected by exchange of notes signed at Dublin June 28,
                    1948, see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts Series No.
                    1828, or 62 Stat. (pt. 3) 2910.]</p>
            </div>
